OL,3,GNEWSAGraduates in their 60s say 'it's
OL,4,Anever too late'
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo new university graduates in their
OL,7,F60s have said it is never late to
OL,8,Flearn.
OL,10,FAngi Mariani, 60, and Angela Moss, 61,
OL,11,Fboth graduated from the University of
OL,12,FSuffolk this week.
OL,14,FMariani, who studied Biomedical Science
OL,15,Fpart-time over six years, said: "It
OL,16,Fshows it is never too late to learn ` I
OL,17,Fthink people should be thinking about
OL,18,Flearning throughout their life,
OL,19,Fwhatever they have a passion for."
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
